#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0695 expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: BASETYPE is present, BASE is populated, and BASE is not equal to AVAL where ABLFL is equal to Y for a given value of PARAMCD and BASETYPE for a combination of device and subject
#note "BASE=100 vs max(AVAL where ABLFL=Y)=100 -> noViolation"
dataset ADLBC class=MD-BDS
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SPDEVID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col BASETYPE type=Char
col ABLFL type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col BASE type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | DEV01 | GLUC | LAST | Y | 100 | 100
---
